  ;; public spec-basis) as AUTHORITY-BEARING DRY-RUN social posts, and — once it holds its own
  ;; mesh-runtime key (self-custodied, no-operator-master-key, ADR-2605231525) under a member
  ;; CACAO leash — signs + emits them itself. This publishes the Kingdom's OWN statecraft (神の
  ;; 王国 統治機構, Charter §0.1) + the portable COFOG standard, transparently (§1.12, 1 SBT=1
  ;; vote, on-chain) — NOT a 'NOT the government' disclaimer. Live broadcast stays Council Lv6+
  ;; + operator + external-authority-signature gated (§1.12/G11); R0 = dry-run. Authority is
  ;; ALWAYS the Council multisig or the adopting state's keys, never a platform/operator key
  ;; (G1 no-operator-master-key). ADR-2606272355.
